<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Oroma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oroma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Oroma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oro</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa</para>
  <para style="mt1">ENZU UMBA OROMU</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu gba a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le laa Ɔshɔshi uwu Oromu. Igbomo a ka ngwu mu kari unga A.D. 56 nana kari unga 57 kwuyengwu bɔkɔ a nda tee a mbwa anu itama iyi iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi fo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu a gyi tee le so mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ dɛ gba e be re mu Oromu mbala Osipeni le. Igbomo a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ kwuyengwu e yi mu ɛnwuyimo iyi luzɛ ndɔlɛ. A ka mba kwupu kwɔlɛ ka la zɔ mba ɔgwuzɛ uwu ikwidufulo uwu Umbwalu mbala lunzɛ undu lu fa laa umbwalu Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mizhikembo iyi a gbɛlɛ enzu umba ɔshɔshi mu Oromu ɛnyi akwɛyi e so mbo Ukpo ilɛma uwu e yi mu ilɛma kwuwo mbo, akwɛyi e so reshi ingyi iso ingyi kwupu wu kwɔlɛ: &lt;&lt;Iso Iyeshi ɛlɛ i zɔ ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi enzu ototo midu wu: i ngyi mu ikwidufulo mu iyemo nzhii ba mu imbwama&gt;&gt; (1.17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a ya iso ɛlɛ ma. A zɔ tee enzu lɛɛbi, laa Azhu loo, laa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo loo, u yi ugɔ uwu ototo mbaa God, moo uwewe akwu onzu uwu ingbomo. Ikwidufulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba i shi enzu ototo mbaa Ukpo le. Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e so ewo iyi bɔkɔ kwunyɔ ungwepo ungwu Ukpo e shi kwuwongwu ilomesu mbala Okrasi le te kwu yi. Umbwalu Okrasi awu oloto mbala God, Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wa wu ma mbaa ekpasu iyi ingbomo mbala luku. Mu ɛmɛ iyɛkwu 5-8 iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ, Ɔpɔlu e kyo e so iso meka iyi Ɛrama iyi Ukpo mbala ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mu luzɛ undu umbwalu Okrasi. Akwɛyi e kyikyi e so ewo iyi bɔkɔ Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ɔ ri mu ikama iyi Ukpo a ka laa enzu lɛɛbi. A zɔ tee itomo iyi bɔkɔ Azhu o to Ɔzhizɔsi mo awu akwu ikama iyi Ukpo a ka le kaa le bo laa enzu lɛɛbi kɛlɛ mbaa esheshi iyi Ukpo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ɔpɔlu e shi egbo tee Azhu o towo Ɔzhizɔsi mo iyɔkpɔɔ mo. Mu imbwama iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ Ɔpɔlu e so iso meka iyi bɔkɔ luzɛ undu Umbwalu Okrasi ifate lalu yi, iyi idɛnyi ipwumo iyi enzu. Ekyo e so iso meka iyi ɛduma iwomo la Ukpo, ɛduma iyi Wambwalu Okrasi o wo la ɛzhi mba mbala laa esu, mbala eyo meka iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ egbo iyi onzu i so wu. A mbwa kwupu kwɔlɛ mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mbala Ukpo iduma.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu iyemo mbala reshi ingyi iso (1.1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Onzu uwunawuna e yi ugɔ uwu isama (1.18—3.20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔgwuzɛ uwu isama uwu Ukpo (3.21—4.25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwunyɔ ungwepo mu Okrasi (5.1—8.39)</para>
  <para style="io1">Izirɛ mu ikama iyi Ukpo (9.1—11.36)</para>
  <para style="io1">Luzɛ undu Umbwalu Okrasi (12.1—15.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso mbala ɛnyi igbɛlɛma iyafyafyi wu (15.14—16.27)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu ngyi munyi mi, Imi Ɔpɔlu, umɛgba mbala uzilɔ uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. Ukpo a ya mi ma akwɛyi a ŋa mi kaa la mi tanu iyi iso iyesheshi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi ngbaa mekyekyi iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu wu ɔ ka mu Kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ akwu meka iyi umɛ wu, Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ a vindɔ onzu akwɛyi a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Odevidi awu; <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />meka iwomo iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo, ɔ zɔ wu te lakwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo mu ekpasu iyɛku bɔkɔ o yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ awu: Onzu ele akwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Meka wu gba Ukpo e shi mi esheshi wu akwɛyi mi kwu uzilɔ kaa la mi ya enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi kaa lo kwu idu lu fulo akwɛyi lo lomo le. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Lunyi tete lu kyo mu enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya mba ma kaa lɔ kwu umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ mi ka yi lunyi lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ lu yi mu Oromu, bɔkɔ Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi yi akwɛyi a ŋa yi kaa la lu mbwalu wu awu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Ukpo Ete nzu mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le shi yi esheshi mbala egbo iyi oloto.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukpo Ilɛma Iyi Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Iyi kwonze, mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kwuwo yi, kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo yi, enzu o yi mu ɛza yi ipwama munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ mi wo wu ɛduma la egbo mi lɛɛbi mu anu itama iyi iso iyesheshi iyi Umɛ wu awu, akwu u uzɔgɔ mi tee mi lolo yi iyɔkpɔɔ <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />mu Ukpo ilɛma mi kwuyengwunanguna. Imi mii nda Ukpo tee gba akwu mu inyama wu, la wu mi ɔgwuzɛ ma kaa la mi so munyi yi kekelele.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Moo mi gyi tee la mi ma yi kaa la mi shi yi rɛshi ingyi kwundu uwu Ukpo ingyi bɔkɔ ri shi yi lu kɔma. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Iyi mi so gba i yi tee, lunyi mbala mi la ki ka esu ɛnwu ma, la mi ka yi ɛnwu ma mu ikwu idu lu fulo mi, lunyi tete la lu ka mi ɛnwu ma mu ikwu idu lu fulo yi. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi wa mbwalu, mi gyi te la lu yitu te izhi riba mi gyi te la mi bo munyi yi ɔgwuzɛ u semo iyɔkpɔɔ. Mi gyi te la mi fya wa mbwalu meka yi kyamate bɔkɔ mi fya meka iyi umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo awu.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Moo ɔlu uwu enzu lɛɛbi u yi mu reshi mi, umba bɔkɔ o wu eyi mo mbala umba bɔkɔ o wu eyi mo mo, umba bɔkɔ akwu egbuduru mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu egbuduru mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Inyi gba i shi mi gyikpɔɔ tee la mi tanu iyi iso iyeshi la lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu yi mu Oromu le.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkpasu Iyi Iso Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Imi mi wo lovya undu iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ mo, kwuwongu inyi gba akwu ekpasu iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i sa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwidu e fulo ma wu le, la Azhu keyi dɛ akwɛyi mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Moo mu iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ gba, Ukpo a wa la ototo wu kwudu le, ototo uwu bɔkɔ o fya wu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu iyemo nzhii ba imbwama, kyamate bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu ototo ee yi kwunyɔ kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Ɔsɛkɛnɛ E Yi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ukpo moshi a zɔ tee e yi mu amba iwomo, mekeka iyi ingbomo mbala ira iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa ongbulolo kwota mu ira mba iwomo <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ukpo e lo mbo inyashi kwuwongu iyi bɔkɔ ifate lo yitu meka iyi Ukpo i nvyemo mo, moo Ukpo mafyi wu a ta yi mba kwudu ndunduu. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Moo ngba bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le, apula wiyifo iyi bɔkɔ eyi iyi onzu e do te i ma yi mo, ekpasu wu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ mbala i yi mo wiyi Ukpo tetete o ma yi gedegede mu apula iyi bɔkɔ e wo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna e yi kwuyi ungwu bɔkɔ a zɔ tee ungwu gba ku shi gba e yi Ukpo mo le mo.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Moo umba o yitu iyi Ukpo, ɔbulɛ ŋa o du wu ma mo kwuwongu akwu Ukpo ba o gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi mo. Egbo ibyima mba iyɔkpɔɔ ba akwiyi umbwa akwɛyi o nyɔlɔ egbo mbo mo mu ipwu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Umba o zɔ tee o yi amasa, ɔbulɛ akwu erendo; <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />akwɛyi o to inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo mo akwɛyi o shi yi apula iyi bɔkɔ o wo yi kyamate onzu mbala afyi mbala izɔfyi mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i pyipyi mubu tayi iyi bɔkɔ i kpomo.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ukpo a ra la enzu mbɔlɛ te e shi kaa lo wo iyira iyi bɔkɔ egbo mbo i gyi mbala ɛnwu mba akwɛyi oo wo apula iyi kashi, iyi lovya mbala esu. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Umba o ŋanga ongbulolo uwu Ukpo ma mbala angba, o lɛ akwɛyi o gbo ɔya la apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo, moo akwu Uwu uwu bɔkɔ e wo apula ɛnyi awu mo. Iduma akwu iyawu iyɔkpɔɔ! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ukpo a ra mba e shi kaa lo wo apula iyi lovya. Eko mbo lala o ŋanga inɔma iyi oko mbala ɔnzɔnu iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo le mo, akwɛyi eko ɔ nɔ mbala eko iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo e wo le mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Tatayi anzɔnu o lafya la inɔma mbala eko iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo e wo le akwɛyi kwofya ungwesu kwu nyɔlɔ mba ma. Anzɔnu o wo apula iyi lovya mbala anzɔnu umbafo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ o ka la ɛmba inyashi iyi bɔkɔ ifama mba kwuwongu iwomo iyira mba.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwuwongwu o shi iyitu iyi Ukpo mu egbo mbo mo, Ukpo a ra mba e shi la egbo mbo iyira kaa lo wo apula iyi bɔkɔ ifate lo wo mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ɔ nyɔlɔma mbala inzumbira iyinayina, ira, ekweyi mbala ira iwomo mbala esu. O nyɔlɔma mbala rise, mbala enzu ingbɛma, mbala ovyo, mbala kwukyoro mbala i ra la onzu makɔ. Umba akwu wakyɛ enzu ma, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />wa tutu esu mo, ɔ gyi Ukpo mo, o lomo mo, ɔ zɔ te o iyitu o ka uwewe ma mbala ɛnwu ikwumo; ɔ gagyi ɛgwuzɛ iyi ira iwomo iyɔkpɔɔ; o lomo la umba ete mbo mbala anyi mba mo; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />o bi egbo mo, oo wo iyi bɔkɔ umba o so te oo wo mo, o yi idɛnyi iyi enzu mo, o yi inyashi iyi onzu mo. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Umba o yitu iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo apula ɛnyi tayi lukwu gba lu fa ma mba le. Tetete, akwu apula ɛlɛ iwomo kɛɛkyi gba o so wu mu iwomo le mo, umba o kyo o mbwama la enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo yi.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ombwu Izɔma Uwu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, umɛza mi, uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ngbɛ onzu uwufo ombu uwoyi awu, ŋɔ yi kwuyi ungwu ɛnyi tayi iwomo mo ndii. Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ngbɛ onzu uwufo ombu uwoyi akwɛyi uŋɔ ba ŋɔ wo apula ɛnyi tete, uŋɔ ŋɔ ngbɛ ɛŋɔ ombu uwoyi tete. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Kinzu ki yitu tee akwu mu ongbulolo gba Ukpo a ngbɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo apula ɛnyi tayi ombu uwoyi le. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Umɛza mi, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ wo apula iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ngbɛ enzu umbafo ombu uwoyi ma yi awu tete! Ŋɔ ma kyamate ŋɔ do te ŋɔ wirima mbaa ombu uwu Ukpo re? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Naa ŋɔ nzhii esheshi iyɛku iyi Ukpo ma mbala idu iyimo wu mbala iwo amba efya mo wu ŋa? Ŋɔ yitu te akwu kwuwongu esheshi wu gba Ukpo e yi mu iwomo te kaa bo kaa tamɛzhi le moo?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ kɔ egbo mo ba ŋɔ pwama mo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ŋɔ yi mɛŋɔ amba ɛlu ikpalama la ɔnu uwu amba umba Ukpo, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ombu ingbɛma wu ototo u bu ta kwudu ndunduu awu. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Moo Ukpo ee shi onzonzu rigbɛ ingyi apula iyi bɔkɔ e wo. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ukpo e shi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ la enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ ɔ kyakpɔ mu iyeshi iwomo, akwɛyi o gagyi inzumbɛku mbala umwɔ mbala kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔo, Ukpo ee shi mbo kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Umba bɔkɔ ɔ gyi ɛmbɛmba, o towo ongbulolo mo akwɛyi o mbwalu iyira, enzu mbamba Ukpo ee wo amba mbala mba gyɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ oo wo ira, inyashi mbala ɛnyiyimo i du mbo: i ye mu Azhu akwɛyi i mbwa mbaa umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo iyeshi ba, Ukpo e shi wu inzumbɛku mbala umwɔ mbala egbo iyi oloto: la Azhu keyi dɛ akwɛyi ee shi umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Moo Ukpo a zɔ kusɛ mo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ o yi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo o ngbomo, ba o kpo ɛdɔma. Tetete, akwu ɛrama iyi Omosisi gba o ra yi akwɛyi o ngbɛ mba ɛdɔma le mo. Tatayi enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛrama iyi Omosisi ba o gbomo, o ngbɛ mba ombu uwoyi mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Moo akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa ɛrama gba o fya ototo mbaa Ukpo le mo, umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɛrama ɛnyi gba o fya ototo mbaa Ukpo le. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, bɔkɔ o yi ɛrama mo ba egbo mbo i za mba akwɛyi o wo apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i zɔ te lo wo, ɛlɛ i zɔ tee umba o yi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo le bi, moo o yi ɛrama iyamba mu egbo mbo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Iwomo mbo ɛlɛ i zɔ tee apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i zɔ tee lo wo, o ka yi ma mu akɔ mba. Egbo mbo tete i zɔ tee tegba i yi le, moo kwuye ungufo egbo mbo i zɔ mba tee umba o ngbomo, kwuye ungufo ba i zɔ mba tee umba o ngbomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Kyamate bɔkɔ iso iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ mi tanu yi awu i so, ɛlɛ ii wo ɔnuwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ekpasu kaa la zɔ ombu uwoyi mu apula iyi bɔkɔ enzu o wo kyokyo.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azhu Mbala Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Uŋɔ kɔ? Ŋɔ ya ɛŋɔ tee Ozhu; ŋɔ wɛlɛ mu ɛrama akwɛyi ŋɔ kwɛnwu tee ŋɔ kwu uwu Ukpo; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ŋɔ yitu iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi tee uŋɔ wo kwuwongu ɛrama i zɔ ŋɔ iyi bɔkɔ i sheshi tee mulɛ; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ŋɔ nyama tee ŋɔ kwu u zɔ upeyi ɔgwuzɛ, ŋɔ kwu ɛbɛ la umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ipwu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ŋɔ kwu u ta erendo amasa, ŋɔ kwu u zɔ ɛmɛ umbelu kiya, kwuwongu ŋɔ yitu tee akwu mu ɛrama gba ŋɔ yi iyitu iyi ongbulolo le. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Inyete uŋɔ, u zɔ umbafo kiya, ŋɔ zɔ ɛŋɔ moo? Uŋɔ u tanu te lɔ wu ɛlɔ mo, ŋɔɔ wu ɛlɔ? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Uŋɔ u za la enzu tee lɔ yama mo, uŋɔ ŋɔ yama? Uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi eshi mo, ŋɔɔ wu ɛlɔ mu ɛnu iyeshi? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Uŋɔ uwu ŋɔɔ kwɛnwu tee ŋɔ yi ɛrama iyi Ukpo, ŋɔ lo Ukpo lovya mu ɛrama wu ifomo? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kyamate bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee: &lt;&lt;Akwu kwuwo yi lunyi Azhu gba umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o siso iyira iyi Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Gba ŋɔɔ mbwalu ɛrama, de ba ɛsɔ izɛma ŋa i sheshi, gba ŋɔ fo ɛrama ma, de ba ŋɔ yi kyamate o do zɛ ŋɔ ɛsɔ ma mo tayi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Gba enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo bɔkɔ ɔ zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mo ɔ mbwalu iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i zɔ te lo wo, Ukpo ee to mbo kyamate enzu umba ɔ zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mo? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwu ɔ zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma mo tetete ba a mbwalu ɛrama, a ngbɛ yi lunyi Azhu ombu uwoyi kwuwongu lu yi ɛrama iyi ɔ ka yi ma o shi yi mɛzhi, ɔ zɛ yi ɛsɔ ma ba lu mbwalu yi mo.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ɛsɔ wu akwiyi kwudu byi, akwu Ozhu mo, moo ɛsɔ izɛma ngboro akwu mu ɛnwu mu kwudu bi mo. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ayimo, onzu uwu akwu Ozhu ngboro gba akwu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ozhu mu egbo mɛmi, uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo a zɛ kwudu ungwɔkwu wu ɛsɔ ma, moo akwu kwuwongu iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu ɛrama mo. Onzu awu tayi ipwɔma wu ii ngyi mbaa Ukpo, moo akwu mbaa enzu mo.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Inyete Azhu o koshi laa enzu umba akwu Azhu mo mungye? Naa rigbɛ ingyi ɛsɔ izɛma akwu mbɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />I yi gyɔɔ mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna! Iyi kwonze, akwu Azhu gba Ukpo e shi mbo iso wu kaa lo gbo yi mo le. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Inyete ba gba umbafo mba o wo iyi bɔkɔ umba ɔ zɔ te o wo mo kɔ? Ɛlɛ i shi Ukpo e wo iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee wo mo? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />I yi tayi mo ndii! Onzu uwunawuna akwu u mu angba, tetete Ukpo ba akwu ongbulolo. Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ siso, enzu lo ma te ŋɔ so ongbulolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">akwɛyi ombu ŋɔ u wɔmakwuyengwu enzu ɔ vu undu ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Inyete gba ira nzu iwomo i wa la ototo uwu Ukpo kwudu gedegede kɔ? Gba Ukpo e lo nzu inyashi, kii zɔ te e wo ototo mo? (Ɛlɛ akwu kwuyo ungwu bɔkɔ onzu uwu inyi igyi uwunawuna e yo le.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Akwu tayi mo ndii! Gba Ukpo la kwu ototo mo, ee wo la ba e do te a ngbɛ kwudu kwɔlɛ ombu uwoyi? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Inyete gba imwangba mi, i wa la ongbulolo uwu Ukpo kwudu gedegede akwɛyi i ka wu la kwupwɔ, kimbe kii shi bɔkɔ o gba ɔ ngbɛ mi ombu uwoyi te mi kwu onzu u wo ingbomo? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Enzu umbafo o mwilo mi te, Imi mi zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La ki wo iyira kaa iyeshi li wɔ!&gt;&gt; Ukpo a ngbɛ mba ombu uwoyi kyakya la iwomo mbo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Ototo E Yi Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Inyete kinzu Azhu, ki koshi la umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo re? Akwu tayi mo ndii! Mi zɔ yi ee tee enzu lɛɛbi, la Azhu, la umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo akwu enzu umba ingbomo. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Onzu ototo ukpɛnyi te e yi mo,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />onzu ukpɛnyi u yitu iyeshi mbala iyira, naa u lɛ Ukpo e yi mo.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Enzu lɛɛbi o kwu Ukpo ɔsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kpɛkpɛmba akwu enzu umbu mbwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">u wo iyeshi e yi mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">ukpɛnyi te e yi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Iso mbo i nyɔlɔma mbala kwukyoro ungwu lukwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">iso iyi angba gba ɛtunɛ mba i so le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">&lt;&lt;Ayi mba i yi rɛnu kyamate ɛtu iyi ɔkwu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Lunzu mbo lu nyɔlɔma mbala iso iyira mbala arikpama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />&lt;&lt;O kɔ ba o-oo wo amba kaa lɔ ngbɛ onzu mo;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />munamuna bɔkɔ umba ɔ ka, itutumo mbala ubugyi gba oo shi yi le.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Umba o yitu iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu i ŋɔ moloto mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />&lt;&lt;O yi iyi iyi Ukpo mu makɔ mba mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Kekelele ki yitu tee iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama iso, i so mbala umba bɔkɔ ɛrama i yi mu reshi mbo, kaa kenzu unga onzu uwunawuna la ka kpalama kaa Ukpo la ngbɛ kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ombu uwoyi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Moo onzu e yi ototo midu iyi Ukpo kwuwongu ɛrama imbwaluma mo; kiya ingyi ɛrama bɔkɔ ii wo gba i yi tee, i zɔ enzu ingbomo mbo.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewo Iyi Bɔkɔ Enzu Oo Fya Ototo Mbaa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Kekelele ɔgwuzɛ uwu o fya ototo ma mbaa Ukpo ba o ta wu kwudu-o. Ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ akwu ɛrama imbwaluma mo, tetete Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzɔ iyi anukenzu i siso meka yi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ukpo ee shi enzu oo yi ototo kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo mbo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ laa enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ɔ mbwalu Okrasi, kwuwongu ikikɔ i yi mo ndii: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />moo enzu lɛɛbi o ngbomo akwɛyi o ndama mbaa isama iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Tetete kwuwongu rɛshi ingyi esheshi iyi Ukpo, enzu lɛɛbi o fya ototo ma mbaa wu mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ a wa mba ma awu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ukpo a ra Ɔzhizɔsi e shi, kaa mu ɛnzhi ifumo wu, lakwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo ma wu, o to mbo ingbomo mbo mo. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kaa la zɔ ototo wu, moo mekyi e yidu akwɛyi a lafya la ingbomo iyi enzu iyekyi, mu kwuye kwɔlɛ ba a lafya la ingbomo mbo fo kaa la zɔ ototo wu. Mu iwomo ɛlɛ, Ukpo a zɔ tee u wu mafyi wu akwu ototo, onzu uwu e kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi, ee shi wu akwu onzu ototo midu iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Kekelele ki kwɛnwu mungye? Mu kiya kinyinyi mo! Kwuwongwu kwuwongumbe? A kwu kwuwongu ki mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi le? Aayimo, akwu kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo nzu mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Moo ki nyama tee onzu aa fya ototo ma mbaa Ukpo mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi kɛɛkyi, moo akwu mu ɛrama imbwaluma mo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Naa Ukpo akwu Ukpo uwu Azhu kɛɛkyi re? A kwu Ukpo uwu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo tete mo? Tegba i yi le. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi. Ee shi Azhu aakwu enzu umba ototo kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo mbo, umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ee shi mbo oo kwu enzu umba ototo tete kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo mbo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Inyete ɛlɛ i zɔ te ɛrama kii shi yi mɛmba kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo re? Ayimo, i yi tayi mo ndii; kinzu ki nyama la ɛrama iyi Omosisi tete.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mbwalu Ɔgwuzɛ Uwu Aburamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Kekelele ki so te meka iyi Aburamu uwu bɔkɔ akwu usɔkwu nzu? A fya mbe mu luzɛ wu undu ikwidufulo? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Gba lɔ zɔ tee o shi wu ototo mbaa Ukpo kwuwongu ɛduma wu, ba le be yi kiya ingyi ɛnwu ikwumo - tetete ba akwu mu idu iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Aburamu e kwu idu e fulo mu Ukpo, akwɛyi kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo wu ɛlɛ, Ukpo a ya wu tee ototo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma, rigbɛ ingyi oo shi mbo o ya ngyi rɛshi mo; akwu rigbɛ ingyi anu mba. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Enzu ba umba bɔkɔ ɔ wɛlɛ mu ikwu idu lu fulo, moo akwu mu ɛduma mo, akwɛyi o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi enzu umba ingbomo ɔsɛkɛnɛ awu ba akwu ikwu idu lu fulo ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a ra yi gba ee shi mbo ototo mbala ɛwu le. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ɛlɛlɛ gba Odevidi e so le bɔkɔ a zɔ tee ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a na wu tee akwu onzu ototo ba akwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ onzu awu ee wo le mo:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ ingbomo mbo o gba yi kpa mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">umba bɔkɔ ingbomo mbo o kokoyi mo!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu ee shi ingbomo wu makɔ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Inyete ɔnyɛ uwu bɔkɔ Odevidi e siso mawu ele akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ ɔ zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma kɛɛkyi re? Aayimo! A kwu uwu umba bɔkɔ ɔ zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mo awu tete. Moo ki zɔ yi yi mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo-o tee, &lt;&lt;Aburamu e kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo, akwɛyi kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo wu, Ukpo a na wu tee akwu onzu ototo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kwuye ungwuna bɔkɔ ɛlɛ i wo? I wo dɛ nana mizhikembo iyi ɔ zɛ Aburamu ɛsɔ ma ŋa? I wo dɛ moo akwu mizhikembo mo. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ɔ zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma mizhikembo akwɛyi ɛsɔ izɛma wu ɛnyi akwu kɛzɔ unga ka zɔ te Ukpo a na wu te akwu onzu ototo kwuwongu a kwidu e fulo mawu dɛ gba ɔ bɔ zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma le. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Aburamu akwu ete uwu enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mo, tetete kwuwongu o kwidu o fulo mu Ukpo, a na mba akwu enzu watoto munyi wu. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />U wu tete akwu ete uwu enzu umba ɔ zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma, umba bɔkɔ akwu ɛsɔ izɛma kɛɛkyi mo, i kyo ɔ zɛ luzɛ undu ikwu idu lu fulo undu bɔkɔ ete nzu Aburamu a zɛ dɛ gba ɔ bɔ zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma le awu.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi Ukpo E So E Shi Mɛzhi Ɔɔ Na Yi Mu Ikwidufulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a za la Aburamu tee kwudu kwɔlɛ aakwu ungwawu mbala ɛdɔ wu awu, akwu kwuwongu Aburamu a mbwalu ɛrama le mo, akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ e kwu idu lu fulo akwɛyi Ukpo a na wu tee akwu onzu ototo. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Moo gba kiya ingyi Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi, oo shi umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɛrama, de ba ikwu idu lu fulo akwu kiya kinyinyi mo, i so i shi mɛzhi iyi Ukpo ba akwiyi umbwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ɛrama i bo la amba umba Ukpo mɛzhi; mbaa bɔkɔ ɛrama i yi mo, ifomo iyi ɛrama ba i yi mo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i siso i shi mɛzhi i ri mu ikwu idu lu fulo, kaa lakwu rɛshi ingyi esheshi iyi Ukpo la ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu lɛɛbi - akwu la wa mbwalu ɛrama kɛɛkyi mo, i kyo la umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo kyamate Aburamu e wo awu tete. Moo Aburamu akwu ete wu wa mbwalu lɛɛbi; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />kyamate kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwo so tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi wo ŋɔ ete uwu enzu lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt; Isiso ishi mɛzhi ɛlɛ ishoshi mu idu iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ Aburamu a kwidu e fulo mawu awu, Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ aa gba la enzu iyimo mu kwuvɔ awu, uwu bɔkɔ ɔkpa wu, aa wa la kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki di yi dɛ mo awu, la ki yi.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Aburamu ba e fulo eyi fo, tetete a kwidu e fulo akwɛyi akwu &lt;&lt;ete uwu enzu riba riba.&gt;&gt; Kyamate kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛdɔ ŋɔ i yi riba kyamate elovyo tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Kwuye kwɔngu lɔri wu lu nda la oderi fo; ɛnwu wu i kpomo-o, oko wu, Osera ba e do te a mba ma fo; tetete e kwu idu lu fulo. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Uwu ba a lafya la ikwu idu lu fulo wu mo, e yi egbo epo mu iso iyi Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi awu mo; ikwu idu lu fulo wu i shi wu ekpasu akwɛyi a du Ukpo ma. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ikyo e yi egbo epo mo ndii tee Ukpo e do te e wo iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi &lt;&lt;Ukpo a na Aburamu tee akwu onzu ototo&gt;&gt; kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo wu le. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ ɔ so tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo a na wu tee akwu onzu ototo&gt;&gt; awu, akwu kwuwo wu kɛɛkyi mo. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ukpo a ka yi kwuwo nzu tete, kinzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ba na nzu tee ki kwu watoto, kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki kwu idu lu fulo mu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e yi Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu mo mu kwuvɔ awu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Kwuwongwu ingbomo nzu, Ukpo a ra la Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e shi kaa le kpomo, akwɛyi o yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ kaa la ki fya ototo ma mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ototo Mbaa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ukpo e to ombu o sha nzu kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo nzu awu, ki yi idigbomo iyi Ukpo mu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ki fya ɔgwuzɛ ma meka wu mu ikwu idu lu fulo nzu akwɛyi ki fye mu esheshi iyi bɔkɔ ki rima ma yi kekelele le. Kinzu ki kwɛnwu mu eyifulomo iyi inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Akwu mu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, ki gba ki kwɛnwu meka iyi inyashi tete, moo inyashi i bo la idu kwɔku, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />idu kwɔku ba i bo la luzɛ undu esheshi, luzɛ undu esheshi ba lu bo la eyifulomo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Eyifulomo ɛlɛ ba i lo nzu lovya mo, kwuwongu Ukpo a nyɔlɔ egbo nzu ma mu idɛnyi wu i zɛ mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi nzu awu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />kwuyengwu ki yi ekpasu iyi ki mbwama laa enzu mo, akwɛyi Okrasi e bo tabɔkɔ kwuye ku kpokya, akwɛyi e kpomo kwuwo nzu, kinzu enzu umba ingbomo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ikɔma kaa onzu le kpomo kwuwongu onzu ototo. Igɔ mo onzu uwufo a bɔ ɛwu kepo mu idu kaa le kpomo kwuwongu onzu uweshi bi. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ukpo ba a zɔ nzu idɛnyi wu gyɔɔ - akwu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo bɛnɛ, gba Okrasi e kpomo kwuwo nzu le.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kwuwongwu lukwu wu, ki yi ototo mbaa Ukpo; akwɛyi a sa nzu ma mbaa amba umba Ukpo tete! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Kinzu ki kwu agewa umba Ukpo mekyi, tetete e wo nzu ki kwu enzu ɛmɛza wu kwuwongu lukwu undu Umɛ wu. Kekelele bɔkɔ ki kwu ɛmɛza umba Ukpo ŋa le, uwu a sa nzu ma mu Okrasi! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ba akwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo; ki mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo mu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ e lonzu mesu mbala Ukpo awu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adɛmu Mbala Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kyamate bɔkɔ ingbomo i zɛ mu onzu ɛnyi gba i fye mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le akwɛyi lukwu ba lu zɛ mu ingbomo lu fye, tatayi gba lukwu lu du uwewe le, moo enzu ndii o ngbomo. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ingbomo i yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ dɛ gba o bo la Ɛrama le; gba ɛrama i yi mo, enzu o yitu iyi ingbomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />I na mu kwuyengwu Adɛmu nzhii ba mu kwuyengwu Omosisi, lukwu lu ri ɛsu iyi enzu, laa umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo mo kyamate Adɛmu bɔkɔ e fo ɔkpa uwu Ukpo ma awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adɛmu e yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ba nyɔ awu.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Rɛshi gyɛngyi mbala ikpamɛzhi ɛnyi ba i yi kya mo, moo rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ri yi kyamate ingbomo iyi Adɛmu te mo. Enzu gyɔɔ o kpomo kwuwongu ingbomo iyi onzu ɛnyi, esheshi iyi Ukpo ba i ka le, enzu gyɔɔ o fya rɛshi ingyi esheshi iyi Ukpo i zɛ mu onzu ukpɛnyi uwu gba akwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ba ri yi ikikɔ mbala ingbomo iyi onzu ɛnyi awu. Ombuwoyi uwu bɔkɔ u mbwalu ingbomo iyi onzu ukpɛnyi ɛnyi i bo la ombu uwoyi uwu &lt;&lt;Lukwu&gt;&gt;; rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ba ri shi nzu ototo mbaa Ukpo akwɛyi ri bo la &lt;&lt;Ombwu uwoshi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />I zɛ mu ingbomo iyi onzu ukpɛnyi, gba lukwu lu ri ɛsu kwuwongu onzu ɛnyi awu le. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o na esheshi mbala rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ingyɛkwu bɔkɔ onzu ukpɛnyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi! I yi bɔkɔ e wo awu, i ka le, i zɛ mu onzu ukpɛnyi awu gba ki fya irɛsu iyi ototo le.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Te gba i yi le, mate bɔkɔ ingbomo iyi onzu ukpɛnyi i ka la enzu lɛɛbi la lukwu awu, te gba ototo uwu onzu ukpɛnyi a ka la enzu lɛɛbi la kwunyɔ le. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kyamate bɔkɔ i pwa alu mo iyi onzu ukpɛnyi i ka la enzu lɛɛbi la lukwu awu, te gba ototo uwu onzu ukpɛnyi a ka la enzu lɛɛbi ototo mbaa Ukpo le.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />O bo la ɛrama kaa ingbomo li kyomo; mbaa bɔkɔ ingbomo i kyomo ba esheshi iyi ukpo ikyomo i ka le. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Moo tabɔkɔ ingbomo i shi lukwu kaa la lu ri ɛsu awu, te gba esheshi iyi Ukpo ii shi ototo e ri ɛsu kaa le bo lo lakwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔɔ i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu le.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpomo Mu Ingbomo, I Yi Kwunyɔ Mbala Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ki so te fo, la ki le mu ingbomo kaa esheshi iyi Ukpo li kyomo? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />I yi tayi mo ndii! Ki kpomo mu ingbomo o i wote bɔkɔ ki gba ki zɛma ma yi kpɔ? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Naa lu yitu tee kinzu umba bɔkɔ o wo nzu obatisima mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, o wo nzu obatisima ikyo mu lukwu wu tete mo re? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />O pwu nzu mo mbala wu i zɛ mu obatisima akwɛyi ki kyo mu lukwu wu, kyamate bɔkɔ o yi Okrasi moo mu lukwu i zɛ mu inzumbɛku iyi Ada awu, kaa la ki zɛ luzɛ undepo.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Moo kyamate bɔkɔ ki kpamesu mbala wu meka iyi lukwu wu i zɛ mu obatisima awu, te gba Ukpo e yi nzu mo mbala wu le tete. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Moo ki yitu tee ari iyekyi o kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu mbala Okrasi-a, kaa ɛnwu nzu iyi ingbomo ɛnyi lo ngbɛ yi ma, kaa la ki kwu enye umba ingbomo fo. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo a wɔma mu ekpasu iyi ingbomo o.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Kinzu ki kpomo mbala Okrasi-e, kwuwo kwɔlɛ ki kwu idu lu fulo tee kii yi kwunyɔ mbala wu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Moo ki yitu te Ukpo e yi Okrasi mo mu lukwu-o, a gba e kpomo fo - lukwu lu yi ekpasu ma wu fo. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Lukwu undu Okrasi e kpomo le, e kpomo kwuwongu ka la mu ekpasu iyi ingbomo izhi ikpɛnyi. Iyimo wu kekelele ba e yi laa Ukpo kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Uŋɔ tete yese ɛŋɔ te ŋɔ kpomo laa ingbomo o, iyimo ŋɔ ba lakwu kwuwongu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi ŋa.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ingbomo li rɛsu mu ɛnwu yi iyi lukwu ɛlɛ fo, kaa la lu nyama la iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu yi i gyi mo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />La lu to ɛnwu yi kaa lu shi ingbomo, kaa lakwu kiya ingyi ɛduma iyira iwomo mo. La lu ra la ɛnwu yi lu shi Ukpo, mate umba bɔkɔ o wa mba ma mu lukwu o bomo mu kwunyɔ tayi; la lu rala ɛnwu yi ngyɔ la lu shi Ukpo kaa lakwu kiya ingyi ɛduma iyi ototo. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ingbomo li rɛsu yi mo, moo lu yi mu ɛrama mo, lunyi ba lu yi mu esheshi iyi Ukpo ŋa.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛgba Umba Ototo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ki wo te fo? Ki le mu ingbomo kwuwongu bɔkɔ ki ŋɔ la ɛrama mo ba ki ŋɔ la esheshi ŋa le? Ayi mo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Lu yitu te gba lu rala ɛwu yi lu shi onzu akwɛyi lu lo wu mo ta enye te, lu kwu enye umba onzu uwu bɔkɔ lu lo wu mo awu - luu kwu enye umba ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ i re la onzu mu lukwu, naa ilomo iyi bɔkɔ ii shi yi luu yi ototo mbaa Ukpo ŋa? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ukpo ba le yi ɛnyi! Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu enye umba ingbomo dɛ-ɛ le, lu na ɛzɔ iyi ongbulolo iyi bɔkɔ o shi yi kekelele mu egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />O wa yi ma mu ingbomo akwɛyi lu vindɔ enye umba kiya ingyi Ukpo a gyi.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Mi so yi ɛlɛ mu ikeshi iyi onzu kwuwongu mi yitu tee onzu e kpɔfɔ. Kyamate bɔkɔ lu koko lu ra la ɛnwu yi lu gbo rinye laa apula iyi kashi mbala ira awu, ta yi gba i yi le lunyi tete ba la lu rala ɛnwu yi la lu gbo rinye laa ototo uwu ee shi yi lu ŋɔ sɛsɛ mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu kwu enye umba ingbomo awu, lu wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi mo. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ kwule ungwu na bɔkɔ lu fya mu apula iyi bɔkɔ lu wo yi iyi bɔkɔ lu wo lovya yi kekelele ŋa le? Kwowungu apula ɛnyi i bo la lukwu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Kekelele ba o wa yi ma mu ingbomo o akwɛyi lu kwu enye umba Ukpo ŋa. Kwule ungwu bɔkɔ luu fya kekele le akwu luzɛ lu sɛsɛ akwɛyi luu fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Moo rigbɛ ingyi ingbomo akwu lukwu, rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ba akwu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛzɔ Iyi Iŋɔma Iyi Oko Mbala Ɔnu Akwu Kyamate Iŋɔma nzu Mbala Okrasi Tayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lu yitu tee, iso iyi mi so le mi so mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yitu iyi ɛrama. Ɛrama i yi ekpasu mu reshi ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kwunyɔ le kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Izɔma yi i yi tee, ɛrama ikyo oko mbala ɔnu mesu tabɔkɔ ɔnuwu e ye la reyi; ba akwiyi gba ɔnu wu e kpomo, oko awu a wɔma mu ɛrama ɛnyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Akwiyi gba oko a ya ɔnu awa gba ɔnu wu e yi la reyi bɛnɛ, o ya wu tee u to kaya, gba ɔnu wu e kpomo-o, a wɔma mu ɛrama ɛnyi-a, gba a ya ɔnu awa lala ba akwu u to kaya fo. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Te gba i yi le ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi tete lu kpomo mu ɛrama-a, kwuwongu lu kyo mu ɛnwu iyi Okrasi; kekelele lu kwu umba wu uwu bɔkɔ o yi wu mo mu lukwu awu kwuwongu kaa la lu wo ɛduma iyeshi iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki zɛma mu ingbomo iyi ɛnwu awu, ekweyi iyi ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i zɔ yi nzu awu i yi mu ɛduma iwomo mu ɛnwu nzu bɛnɛ, akwɛyi ki wa la imwuma iyi i ka nzu la lukwu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Kekelele Ukpo a wanzu ma mu ɛrama a, kwuwongu ki kpomo mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki ma nzu ma dɛɛ awu; kaa la ki wo ɛduma mu ɔgwuzɛ uwepo ele mu imbwama iyi kwundu, moo lakwu mu ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma awu fo.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi Mbala Ekpasu Iyi Ingbomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Akwu tee ki so kekelele tee ɛrama akwu ingbomo ŋa mo? Akwu tayi mo! Ɛrama gba i zɔ mi ingbomo le, moo ɛrama gba li zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wo ekweyi iyi kiya ingyi onzu awa mo,&gt;&gt; Mi bi yitu iyi ɛnyi mu egbo mi mo. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ba i se mu ɔkpa gba ingbomo i fya kapa ma gba i yela ekweyi iyi ɛnwu ma mami le. Gba ɛrama li yi mo ingbomo li bi kpomo. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ɛrama i yi mo awu mi ye lakwunyɔ; ɛrama bɔkɔ i bo ŋa le, akwɛyi ingbomo i fya ekpasu ma, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />ba imi mi kpomo. Akwɛyi ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ ifate li bo la kwunyɔ le i bo la lukwu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ingbomo i fya kapa ma i se mu ɛrama, i kyoro mi mo akwɛyi i ngbɛ mi ma. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛrama mafyi yi i yi sɛsɛ, ɛrama i yi ngbulolo ba i shoshi. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Akwu te ingyi bɔkɔ ki shoshi le ki ka mi la lukwu ŋa mo? Ayimo! Akwu kwuwongu kaa lo zɔngɔma ingbomo ma le gba kiya ingyi ki shoshi awu ki bo la lukwu le, akwu mu ɛrama gba ingbomo i zɔ ɛnwu yi ma tee akwu ingbomo shɛ le.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ovyo Uwu E Yi Mɛmi Iyi Egbo Iyi Onzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ki yitu tee Ɛrama akwu kiya ingyi kwundu; Imi ba mi kwu onzu uwu inyi igyi, unye uwu ingbomo. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Mi zɔngɔma iyi mi yi mu iwomo le ma mo, Moo akwiyi mi gyi le gba mi yi mu iwomo le mo, iyi mi gyi mo le gba mii wo le. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Akwiyi gba mii wo iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi mo, de ba mi nyama tee ɛrama akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Te gba i yi le, akwu Imi gba mi yi mu apula ɛnyi i womo le mo, akwu ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ i yi ma mi le gba iyi mu iwomo le. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Mi yitu tee kiya ingyi ki shoshi kikpikpɛnyi te ki yi mami mo, kwuwongu mi kwu onzu uwu ingbomo. Moo Imi mi gyi te la mi wo kiya ngyeshi, ba mi do ngyi iwomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Akwu esheshi iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi te kaa mi wo le gba mi wo le mo; ɔbulɛ, iyira iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi te kaa mi wo yi mo le gba mi wo le. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Kekelele akwiyi gba mii wo kiya ingyi mi gyi mo, akwu imi gba mi wo ngyi awu mo; akwu ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ iyi mami le gba i wo ngyi awu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Akwɛyi mi ma yi mu ɛrama tee: kwuyengwu mi gyi la mi wo esheshi, mi ma ɛnwu mi te mi wo ira. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Moo mu egbo mi mɛmi mɛmi, mi mwɔnyɛ mu ɛrama iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Imi ba mi ma ɛrama iyifo i yi mu ɛduma iwomo mu ɛnwu mi, i kiri ewa la ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi le, i ra mi iwo unye uwu ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu ɛduma iwomo mu ɛnwu mi le. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mi kpɛdɔ-ɔ! Uwe bɔkɔ a na mi ma mu ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ i sheye mi mu lukwu le? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ɛnyi la kwiyi Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e wo yi mo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Mu egbo mi: imi mi kwu unye uwu ɛrama iyi Ukpo, ɛnwu mi ba ii wo ɛduma la ɛrama iyi ingbomo.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kwunyɔ Mu Kwundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi o ngbɛ mba ombuwoyi fo. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Moo mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, ɛrama iyi Kwundu i wa mi ma mu ɛrama iyi ingbomo mbala lukwu oo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Moo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i do ngyi iwomo mo kwuwongu inyɛma iyi onzu, Ukpo e wo ngyi mo, a lɔ la Umɛ wu e bo mu ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ iyi mate iyi onzu te kaa lakwu isabɔ iyi ingbomo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kaa iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i gyi awu li nyɔlɔma ma nzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi mu luzɛ mu Kwundu, ba la akwu mu iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu i gyi mo awu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mu iyi ɛnwu bɔkɔ i gyi bi awu o shi egbo mbo mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu mba i gyi; enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mu iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu a gyi ba o shi egbo mbo mu iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu a gyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />I shi egbo mu apula iyi ɛnwu i bo la lukwu, i shi egbo mu iyi Kwundu ba i bo la kwunyɔ mbala idigbomo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Akwiyi gba enzu o shi egbo mu apula iyi ɛnwu o vindɔ enzu umbeyi umba Ukpo. Moo o lomo laa ɛrama iyi Ukpo mo, ba o do yi iwomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o lolo la apula iyi ɛnwu, oo she la Ukpo mo.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Lunyi ba lu yi mu iwomo iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu yi i gyi mo, lu yi mu iwomo iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Umkpo a gyi, akwiyi gba Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi ma yi. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi Kwundu uwu Okrasi mo, akwu uwu Okrasi mo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Akwiyi gba Okrasi e yi ma yi, ɛnwu yi i kpomo la ingbomo o, Kwundu ba a kwa yi kwunyɔ kwuwongu o shi yi toto mbaa Ukpo o. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Akwiyi gba Kwundu uwu Ukpo wu e yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo mu lukwu awu e yi ma yi, uwu wu e yi Okrasi mo mu lukwu awu tete ee shi ɛnwu yi iyi lukwu ɛlɛ kwunyɔ, izɛ mu Kwundu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ma yi awu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki ra la kwokpa, ba akwu te kaa la ki wo iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu iyi ingbomo ɛlɛ i gyi mo. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Moo akwiyi gba lu ŋɔ mu iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu yi ingbomo ɛlɛ i gyi iwomo, lu kpomo; ba akwiyi gba lu rala Kwundu akwɛyi lu ngbɛ ira iyi ɛnwu yi ma, luu yi kwunyɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to mbo keyi akwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Moo Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ki na le a ra nzu e wo enye mo ba e lo nzu iyi mo, kwundu awu ba a ranzu e wo ɛmɛ umba Ukpo. Ma wu gba ki yama tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 8:15">&lt;&lt; Ada! Ada mi.&gt;&gt;le <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo mafyi wu e kyo mbala kwundu ungwa nzu a zɔ tee ki kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Mate bɔkɔ ki kwu ɛmɛ le, kii fya iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e sheyi laa ɛmɛ wu awu, iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi laa Okrasi awu kii fya yi tete, akwiyi gba ki ma inyashi mbala Okrasi, kii fya inzumbɛku wu.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">inzumbɛku Iyi Bɔkɔ I Yi Mu Keyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mi ma yi tee inyashi iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu i mama le, o manda yi mbala inzumbɛku iyi bɔkɔ ki bi fya yi mu keyi le mo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Moo apula lɛɛbi i yi mu igyakpɔɔ kaa li rigbo laa kwɔfyi ungwu keyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ umbana bɔkɔ akwu ɛmɛ wu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Moo apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo yi i kpɛdɔma, akwu mu i gyi ma yi mo, kwuwongu Ukpo gba a gyi tee li yi tayi le, Tetete ki yi eyifulomo <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />te apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo yi awu oo wa yi ma mu rinye ingyi ivama akwɛyi i kyo mu inzumbɛku iyi ɛmɛ umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o wɔ ma mu rinye e awu i rimo.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ki yitu te apula iyi bɔkɔ o wo yi le lɛɛbi i yi mu ibɛma nzhii ba ɔnɛ te kyamate ofya umbu kwomba tayi. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Akwu ɛnyi kɛɛkyi mo, kinzu mafyi nzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi Kwundu uwu bɔkɔ akwu rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ingyi kenze awu, ki yi mu ibɛma mu egbo nzu mate bɔkɔ ki rima ki gbo la Ukpo kaa la ra nzu le wo ɛmɛ wu kaa la wa nzu ma mu rinye. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Moo akwu mu eyi i fulomo ɛlɛ gba o sa nzu ma le, Ba kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki fulo eyi ngyi awu gba ki ma ngyi-aa akwu eyifulomo fo. Uwe bɔkɔ e fulo eyi mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi-e? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Akwiyi gba ba ki fulo eyi mbaa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki di yi ngyi-e mo, ki yidu mu irima.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Tatayi gba Kwundu a mbwa nzu ma mu inyashi nzu le. Moo ki yitu ewo iyi bɔkɔ i fate la ki lɛ Ukpo mo. Kwundu mafyi wu gba a kpa ɛshɛku laa Ukpo kwuwo nzu la ibɛma iyi bɔkɔ kenzu ke do yi isomo mo le. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e feyi mɛzhi iyi egbo iyi onzu awu, e yitu iyi egbo iyi kwundu, kwuwongu kwundu a kpa ɛshɛku la Ukpo kwuwongu enzu wu ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ki yitu tee mu kiya ingyinangyina Ukpo ee wo ɛduma iyeshi laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwu idɛnyi wu, umba bɔkɔ uwu a ya mba ma mu ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a gyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Moo enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e yitu mbo kpeke awu, umba gba a ŋa mba kaa lo yi kyamate Umɛ wu le, kaa Umɛ awu lakwu Umɛ uwu kwonze meka iyi wa mbwalu guruguru. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba awu, umba gba a ya mba ma le, umba bɔkɔ a ya mba ma awu, umba gba e lo mbo mesu mbala ɛwu le, umba bɔkɔ e lo mbo mesu mbala ɛwu awu, umba gba e shi mbo inzumbɛku wu le.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idɛnyi Iyi Ukpo Mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ki so tee fo, akwiyi gba Ukpo e yi mbala nzu, uwe bɔkɔ e do ewa ikirimo mbala nzu? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ukpo a nyi nzu Umɛ wu ma mo, a ra wu e shi nzu lɛɛbi, ii wo te bɔkɔ akwu apula lɛɛbi e shi nzu rɛshi mo? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Uwe bɔkɔ e fu ombu e lo enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa, Ukpo gba e to ombu a sha mba le. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Uwe bɔkɔ a ngbɛ onzu ombu uwoyi? Akwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mo bɔkɔ e yi kwunyɔ, ba a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungu Ukpo bɔkɔ e yi mu ɛshɛku ikpama kwuwo nzu! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Uwe bɔkɔ aa ka nzu ma mbala idɛnyi iyi Okrasi? Inyashi naa kinɔ naa rigɔ naa rewa naa lonzu naa uzhi widɔ naa iyi ilomo naa lukwu ŋa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Mate bɔkɔ o ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Kwuwo ŋɔ gba ki ŋɔ mu iyi iyi lukwu kwuye ungunanguna le;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">o wo nzu kyamate ilɔ umba bɔkɔ o sheye mbo mu ingbɛma tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ayi mo, mu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ki bima i zɛ mu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi nzu awu! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Moo Imi mi yitu te kiya kinyinyi ki do nzu i kama mbala idɛnyi wu mo, kala lukwu naa kwunyɔ, naa alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo, naa eyo umbeyi, laa kekelele naa kwu ta kwu sheye keyi, naa ekpasu iyinayina, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />naa ɛzhi iyoshi, naa indomo, naa apula iyi bɔkɔ o wo yi lɛɛbi, iyi bɔkɔ ii do te ii ka nzu ma mbala idɛnyi iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu, i yi mo.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpo Mbala Enzu Umba Uwu A Ŋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee Imi mi kwu uwu Okrasi, akwu imulo gba mi so yi le mo. Mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo egbo mi i ye mi mu isomo tayi <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />te mi yi ubugyi uwakuu mbala oga ilomo uwu bɔkɔ u bomo mu akɔ mi mo. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Moo akwiyi gba ii wo mo, Ukpo la ba ta mi kenzu akwɛyi oo ka mi ma mbala Okrasi kwuwongu ɛmɛnɛ mi umba bɔkɔ ki kwu ɛnzhi wakpɛnyi awu. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Umba akwu enzu umba Azhu. Umba Ukpo e to mbo akwɛyi e wo mbo ɛmɛ wu, mbala inzumbɛku, mbala iso i shi mɛzhi, mbala ɛrama inama, mbala oya igbomo kpɛkpɛyi akwu iyamba. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Umba o yi kwomba mbala umba asɔkwu umba Azhu, akwɛyi oo wa kwomba ungwu Okrasi te a wɔ munyi mba, uwu akwu Ukpo uwu ingyinangyina, iduma akwu iyawu iyɔkpɔ! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Akwu te iso iyi Ukpo i fɔma le mo, moo akwu enzu umba Izirɛ lɛɛbi gba akwu enzu umba Ukpo le mo. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Nana kwuwongu umba akwu ɛdɔ wu akwɛyi umba akwu ɛmɛ umba Aburamu mo. Ukpo a za la Aburamu tee: &lt;&lt;Akwu mu Aziki gba ŋɔɔ yi eye umba bɔkɔ mi siso mi shi mɛzhi le.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba i yi te mɛɛ, akwu ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ o mba mba imbama gba akwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo le mo, ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e siso e shi mɛzhi le gba akwu ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu le. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Iso iyi Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi i yi tee: Aburamu, kari ngafo kwuye kwɔlɛ te shaka mii gbama, Osera aa mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Akwu ɛnyi kɛɛki mo, Orebeka a mba ɛmɛ apiri laa onzu ukpɛnyi, usɔkwu nzu Aziki. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Keyi kaa lo mba apiri mbɔlɛ, mbala keyi kaa lo wo kiya ingyeshi naa ingyira, kaa mu amasa ikama iyi Ukpo, kiya ingyi bɔkɔ uwu a ŋa la gba kii yi le, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />akwu kwuwongu ɛduma mo akwu kwuwongu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a yama awu, mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo, o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwakɔ aakwu unye uwu umɛ uwɛri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Tatayi gba o ka le tete mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee: &lt;&lt;Mi mi gyi Ɔzhɛkɔbu, Isɔ ba mi towo wu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />kekelele kii zɔ te Ukpo e wo nzu ɔnyɛ mo awu mo? Ayimo ndii! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Moo Ukpo a za la Omosisi te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu mi gyi te mi ma eyembembyi wu, gba mi ma eyembembyi wu le, onzu uwu mi gyi te la mi ma inyashi wu gba mi ma inyashi wu le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, akwu mu inyama naa ekpasu iyi onzu mo, ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu eyembembyi iyi Ukpo imama. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Moo mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo, o za la Ofero ɔsu uwu Izhipiti tee: &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu ɛlɛ gba mi shi ŋɔ ɛsu iyi Izhipiti le, kaa la mi zɔ ekpasu mi mu reshi ŋɔ, akwɛyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi oo pwa ɛnyi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Ukpo a ma eyembembyi iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi le, onzu uwu ba a gyi te egbo wu li kɔma ba ee shi yi i kɔma le.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amba Umba Ukpo Mbala Eyembembyi Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Igboshimo ukpɛnyi yi ee yo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba Ukpo a gba a ma ingbomo nzu? Uwe ba e do isama mbala wu ngyɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ kwu uwe ngyɔ bɔkɔ ŋɔ do Ukpo opwu igbama? I shoshi te kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e wo ngyi le la ki za wu te, &lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo mi te?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />U mbo lu wu mu lo mbo e yi ekpasu iyi ee wo ɛduma mu lo mbo ewo iyi bɔkɔ a gyi. Mu lo mbo ndɔndu, e do te ee mbo lu wu undufo ka lo wo ɛduma iyeshi ma ndu, undufo ba lo wo ɛduma iyi umbwa ma ndu.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Akwiyi gba Ukpo a gyi te la zɔ amba wu ma, kaa la gba la zɔ ekpasu wu ma, akwɛyi e yidu a ra la amba wu meka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ a ba zɔ mba amba wu, umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo te o ngbɛ mba ɛdɔma awu. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ukpo e yidu kwuwongu kaa lo zɔ inzumbɛku iyɛku wu laa enzu umba bɔkɔ a ma inyashi mba awu, umba bɔkɔ a nɔngɔ mba ma ngbaa mu iyemo kwuwongu inzumbɛku wu <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />kinzu, e kyo a ya nzu tete, akwu mɛmi iyi Azhu kɛɛki mo, i kyo enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo tete. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Mate bɔkɔ e so mu kwokpo ungwu Osiya tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu enzu mi mo mi ya mba te &lt;enzu mi&gt;;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">umba bɔkɔ mi gyi mbo mo awu ba mi ya mba te &lt;Umba igyima mi.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Tetete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;&lt;Mu riyi ngyɛngyi mbaa bɔkɔ Ukpo a za mba tee, lu kwu enzu mi mo awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Mu riyi ngyɛngyi Mi ya mba tee ɛmɛ umba Ukpo ureyi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Anukenzu Azaya e siso mu opwu uwɔkwu meka iyi Izirɛ tee: Enzu umba Izirɛ o yi riba mate ɔgyɛ uwu risu tayi lala, akwu enzu kɛki meka mba gba oo fya isama ma le. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Moo Ukpo a ŋaa zɔ umbu wu meka iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛ efyefya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />I yi mate bɔkɔ Azaya e so kwonze: Lakwu te Ɔkwu edego-ala e shi ɛdɔ nzu rito mo, la ki bi yi mate Ɔsɔdɔmu tayi, la ki bi yi mate Ogomora tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izirɛ Mbala Iso Iyeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Kekelele kinzu ki so te? Te enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, umba o gagyi iŋɔma iyeshi mbala Ukpo mo, o fya yi ma, iŋɔma iyeshi mbala Ukpo mu ikwu idu lu fulo mbo; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />enzu umba Izirɛ ba o mbwalu ɛrama kaa lo yi ototo midu iyi Ukpo, umba ba o fya yi ma mo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwuwongwu kwuwongumbe? Akwu kwuwongu o gagyi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ikwu idu lu fulo mo, akwu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ɛduma iwomo mbo. Akwɛyi umba o lɛfyi mu &lt;&lt;kwoki kwu lɛfyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Mate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;La lu yese, Imi mi bɔ kwoki mu Ɔzayɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ungwu kwuu shi enzu o lɛfyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">kwoki ungwu kwuu shi o kpa mɛzhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">onzu uwu ba e fulo idu mawu o lo wu lovya gbee mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, igyima iyi egbo mi lɛɛbi mbala Ukpo mi ilɛma kwuwo mbo gba akwu te, lo fya isama ma. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Imi mafyi mi mi mi to mbo izɔgɔ tee, umba o bɔ kwushi mu Ukpo imbwaluma, i bɔ kwushi mba ɛlɛ ba akwu mu iyitu mo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Moo umba o yitu iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo bɔkɔ enzu o yi ongbulolo mbala wu mo, akwɛyi umba ba o gyakpɔɔ mu ɔgwuzɛ mba imbwaluma; akwɛyi umba o ra la ɛmba o shi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi enzu oo yi ototo mbala wu mo. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Moo Okrasi gba akwu imbwama iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi le, kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu idu lu fulo mawu, ee yi ototo mbala wu.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isama Akwu Iyi Uwewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Moo Omosisi a ka iso meka iyi ototo uwu bɔkɔ oo fya wu mu ɛrama imbwaluma tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛrama ɛlɛ i zɔ te lo wo, le lomo la yi iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ba kwu so iso meka iyi iŋɔma iyi ototo mbala Ukpo mu ɔgwuzɛ iyi ikwu idu lu fulo tee: &lt;&lt;Ki za la ɛŋɔ te uwe aa yama moshi?&gt;&gt; (iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba akwu tee, kaa le bo la Okrasi mɛzhi). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Nana ki yo kwuyo tee, uwe bɔkɔ e ri ngbaa mɛzhi mu aleku?&gt;&gt; (iluma i yi tee, kaa le yi Okrasi mo mu kuvɔ). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Iso iyi Ukpo i so te?&gt;&gt; Iso i yi kɛlɛ mbala ŋa, i yi mu kenzu ŋɔ mbala egbo ŋɔ&gt;&gt;, iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba akwu te, ilɔ iyi ikwu idu fulo iyi bɔkɔ ki yeyi mu izɛma. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ilɔ gba akwu tee, gba ŋɔ zɔ mu kenzu ŋɔ gedegede tee Ɔzhizɔsi akwu Ɔkwu akwɛyi ŋɔ shi egbo tee Ukpo e yi wu mo mu lukwu, ŋɔɔ fya isama ma. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Moo akwu mu ikwidu fulo nzu gba kii yi ototo midu iyi Ukpo le; moo akwu mu izɔma gedegede mu kenzu nzu gba kii fa isama ma le. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e shi egbo mawu lovya luu wo wu mo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Isɛma i yi mo, laa Azhu loo laa umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, enzu lɛɛbi akwu wakpɛyi; Ukpo akwu Ɔkwu ukpɛnyi, uwuwuu gba akwu Ɔkwu uwu uwewe le ba ee shi rɛshi gyɔɔ la onzu uwu bɔkɔ a nda wu. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ya Ɔkwu ma aa fya isama ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />I wo te ba o ya wu ma iyi imbwama akwiyi gba o o kwu idu lu fulo ma wu mo? Akwiyi gba o do zɛ mba ilɔ mo, oo wo te o kwu idu lu fulo? Akwiyi gba o do zɛ mba ilɔ mo, oo wo te ba oo pwa? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Oo wo te ba oo zilɔ akwiyi gba wa zilɔ o lɔ mba ma mo. Mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu kiya ingyeshi gba enzu o zɛ mu alɛ mba o bo la ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Akwu enzu lɛɛbi gba ba o nyama la ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi ɛlɛ le mo. Moo Anukenzu Azaya mafyiwu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, uwe a nyama la ilɔ nzu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ikwu idu lu fulo i ngyi mu ilɔ iyesheshi ipwama, akwɛyi ilɔ ba i ngyi mu rɛnu ingyi Okrasi itama.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Imi ba mi yo kwuyo tee: enzu o do pwa ɛlɛ mo re? Ee o pwa yi ee, moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ mba i kama munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">iso mba i kama mu ibwama iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Mi gba mi yo kwuyo kpɔ tee: enzu umba Izirɛ o zɔngɔma yi ma mo re? Omosisi mafyi wu gba akwu onzu uwu kwonze uwu a zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Mi to ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ akwu kiya kyinyinyi te mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">kaa la lu wo rise mbo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">akwɛyi mi to enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi iyitu mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">kaa la mi shi mbo lo wo amba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Tete Anukenzu Azaya e so gedegede tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Enzu umba o yemi mu igagyima mo gba o fya mi ma le;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Imi mi zɛ mi ma la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yo kwuyo mi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Mɛka iyi enzu umba Izirɛ ba a zɔ tee, la utu la ɔnu enzu umba bɔkɔ oo lo mi mo mo ba oo towo mi mo awu, mi yembo mu iyama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Eyembembyi Iyi Ukpo Mɛka Iyi Enzu Umba Izirɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Kwuyo ungwu bɔkɔ mii yo gba akwu tee: Ukpo e towo enzu wu mo re? Aayimo! Imi mafyi mi mi kwu onzu uwu Izirɛ, ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu, mu udaba uwu Obezhami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Ukpo e towo enzu wu umba bɔkɔ a ŋa mu iyemo mo. Lunyi lu yitu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ, mbaa bɔkɔ anukenzu Elazha e lewa iyi enzu umba Izirɛ midu iyi Ukpo tee: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, o ngbɛ umba anukenzu ŋɔ ma akwɛyi o shiri ala ŋa ma; Imi kɛɛki gba mi shi le, ba o yemi mu igagyima tee kaa lo ngbɛ mi ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ukpo a gba wu opwu tee: &lt;&lt;Mi shɛlɛmi enzu edubu erewo umba bɔkɔ o do gbo oya laa eshi iyi Obaalu dɛ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Tegba i yi le kekelele: enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa kwuwongu esheshi wu o degbo o shimo. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Akwiyi gba o ŋa mba kwuwongu esheshi, kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu la zɔ tee Ukpo a ŋa wu kwuwongu ɛduma wu mo. Moo gba Ukpo aa ŋa onzu kwuwongu ɛduma wu, de ba esheshi wu akwiyi ongbulolo mo. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kekelele kii mbwa yi te? Tee enzu umba Izirɛ o fya kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o yengyi mu igagyima mo. Enzu kwɛɛ byi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa gba o fya ngyi le; washimo ba o se alu mba ma mbaa iyama iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Mate bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu so tayi tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo e shi egbo mbala akɔ mba li shipu; nzhii ta ɔnɛ te, eyi mbo i mɛbɛ mo alu mba ba i pwama mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Odevidi kpɔ a zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;Ɔnuwunawuna bɔkɔ o bo o ŋɔma tee lo ri kiya, lakwu kwuda mba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">Ukpo le shi lo ta ma ngu, kwusa lakwu wamba ma!<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ukpo le shi eyi mbo lo peyi kaa lo ma ɛbɛ mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ɔsu mbo lu kwumo mu inyashi iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi yo kwuyo te mɛɛ, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Azhu o lɛfyi awu, o kpa mɛzhi ba o gba la iyimo fo re? Aayimo! Kwuwongwu ingbomo mbo akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o fya isama ma, kaa lakwu rise la Azhu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ingbomo iyi Azhu i bo la inzumbeshi la kwudu kwɔlɛ, ifɔma mba mu kwundu ba i ka la esheshi iyɛku la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. Akwiyi gba Azhu lɛɛbi o kyo mbo, esheshi ii ka le gyɔɔ!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isama Iyi Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Azhu mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Iso ɛlɛ mi so mbala lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo awu: Tabɔkɔ mi kwu uzilɔ la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo le, Imi mi kwu ɛnwu mu ɛduma mi. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Mu iwomo mi ɛlɛ, ingboshimo enzu mi oo wo rise, akwɛyi umbafo mbo oo fya isama ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Moo tabɔkɔ Ukpo e towo mbo mo awu, Ukpo e shi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ bɔkɔ akwu agewa wu awu o vindɔ ɛmɛza wu. Iluma iyi i na mba ba akwu kwuwongu mbe? Iluma u kwunyɔ la la enzu umba o kpomo-o. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Akwiyi gba kwuri ungwu kwoburedi ungwu kwonze akwu ungwu Ukpo, de ba kwoburedi ngyɔ akwu ungwu Ukpo tete; akwiyi gba akpa iyi uwɛyi o shi yi Ukpo, ende ngwu akwu iya wu tete. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Gba ende iyifo iyi uwɛyi uwu olivu o kpolo yi mo, akwɛyi uwɛyi uwu olivu uwɔsɛ, o kyo ngwu mbala kwuwɛyi kwɔngwu. Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo lu yi mate uwɛyi uwu olivu uwɔsɛ tayi, akwɛyi kekelele lunyi lu yi mu rigbɛ ingyɛkwu ifyama ingyi bɔkɔ ki ngyi mbaa Azhu. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, lunyi la lu nzhii enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpolo mbo mo mate ende tayi mo. Lu kwu ɛnwu iyi mbɛ? Lunyi lu yi mate kwonde tayi; la lu yitu tee lunyi lu ra laa akpa mo, akpa gba i ra yi le. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ingboshimo ŋɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akpa ɛnyi o kpolo yi moo kaa li she mi ɔgwuzɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Tegba i yi le. O kpolo yi mo kwuwongu o yi ikwu idu fulo mo, lunyi ba lu rima kpakiri kwuwongu lu kwu idu lu fulo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu kwu ɛnwu ma yi mo; lunyi ba la lu wiyi. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ukpo a ma eyembembyi iyi Azhu, umba bɔkɔ akwu ende shɛ le mo; lu mate a lu yi afyima bi re? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Munɛ ki ma tee, mbafo Ukpo a zɔ enzu esheshi, mbafo ba a ma eyembembyi mbo mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o lafya la imbwaluma Ukpo a ma eyembembyi mbo mo, lunyi ba a zɔ yi esheshi, gba lu zɛ luzɛ mu esheshi wu. Akwiyi gba lu wo tayi mo, lunyi tete o kpolo yi mo. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Akwiyi gba Azhu o gba o kwu idu o fulo, Ukpo aa gba mba ma mu riyi mba ingyeki; moo Ukpo e do yi iwomo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Lunyi bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo lu yi mate kwonde ungwu uwɛyi uwɔsɛ ungwu bɔkɔ o kpolo ngwu mo akwɛyi o fya ngwu ma mbala kwuwɛyi ungwu olivu ungwu bɔkɔ o gba ngwu igbama. Azhu o yi mate kwuwɛyi kwɔlɛ; ii kɔma la Ukpo mo tee la fya ende iyi bɔkɔ o kpolo yi mo mbala kwuwɛyi yi.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyembembyi Iyi Ukpo Mɛka Iyi Enzu Lɛɛbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kwunvyeru ungwu ongbulolo ungwu bɔkɔ mi gyi te la lu yitu gba e yi tee, mi gyi te la lu mɛnwu yi mate enzu umba amasa mo. Ukpo e shi egbo iyi enzu umba Izirɛ umbafo tee li kɔma iyi kwuye bwɛ nzhii ba enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo o ŋɔ mbaa Ukpo o nyɔlɔma dɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ɔlɛ gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ enzu umba Izirɛ oo fya isama ma le: Mate bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu so tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Usama aa wɔ mu Ɔzayɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">akwɛyi ira iyinayina mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzhɛkɔbu aa wa yi kwudu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Imi mi siso ɛlɛ mii shi mɛzhi mbala mba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">kwuyengwu mii gbala ingbomo mbo mii kpa mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwuwongwu anu itama iyi iso iyesheshi, Azhu akwu agewa umba Ukpo akwɛyi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo awu akwu esheshi meka yi. Kwuwogu bɔkɔ akwu iŋama iyi Ukpo awu, akwɛyi umba akwu ɛmɛza umba Ukpo kwuwongu umba asɔkwu mba. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Moo Ukpo e shi ɛnwu kwungbɛ meka iyi onzu uwu a ya wu ma ba e lo wu esheshi mo. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Moo lunyi mafyi yi mekyi lu lomo la Ukpo akwɛyi kekelele ba Ukpo a ma eyembembyi yi kwuwongu Azhu o towo Ukpo imbwalu ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Tatayi umba Azhu o towo Ukpo imbwaluma tete, kwuwongu Ukpo a ma eyembembyi yi awu, uwu ba a ma eyembembyi mba kekelele. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Moo Ukpo e wo enzu lɛɛbi kyamate enzu umba o fu mbo mu ugu ugyi tayi kwuwongu ingbomo mba kaa laa zɔ mba lɛɛbi eyembembyi wu .<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi La Kwu Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Apula iwomo iyeshi iyi Ukpo, mbala ilukwu wu mbala iyitu wu akwu iyɛku! Ewo iyi apula wu iwomo mbala ɛgwuzɛ wu, Uwe e do yi izɔngɔma? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tee: &lt;&lt;Uwe ba e yitu iyi egbo iyi Ukpo? Nana uwe ba akwu u ta wu amasa? <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Uwe bɔkɔ e shi wu kiya dɛ-ɛ, kaa la gba wu la kwɔkpa iwama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Moo apula lɛɛbi uwu gba e wo yi, apula lɛɛbi i yi le akwu kwuwo wu, ba lɛɛbi akwu iyawu. inzumbɛku akwiyi Ukpo ɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kwunyɔ Mu Ɛduma Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi, kwuwongu eyembembyi iyi Ukpo nzu Mii kpa yi ɛshɛku tee: la lu shi ɛnwu li kwu isabɔ ireyi la Ukpo, ɛkɛrikɛri iyi bɔkɔ i she la Ukpo. Ɛlɛ gba akwu oya igbomo la Ukpo uwu ongbulolo le. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />La lu nyama enzu lo shi yi kaa la lu wo apula mate enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, lunyi ba la lu nyama kaa Ukpo le shi egbo ibyima yi li yi kikɔ, Akwɛyi ɛlɛ ii shi lu yitu iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, apula iyi bɔkɔ i sheshi, i nya wu ma ba i yi yɛriri.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwuwongwu esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi, Mii za la uwewe meka yi tee: onzu le to ɛnwu tee a ka iyi bɔkɔ ishoshi te le yi ma mo. Uŋɔ ba kwu onzu U byegbo ɔnyɛnyɛ, li zɛ kyakya mbala ikwu idu fulo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi ŋɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Kinzu ki yi asanga iyi ɛnwu riba mu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi, asanga ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi ɛduma ikikɔ ikɔkɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Tatayi gba i yi le, mate bɔkɔ ki yi riba awu, kwuwongu Okrasi kinzu ki kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi, akwɛyi kinzu ki kwu umbesu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ishoshi la ki wo ɛduma mu rɛshi nzu ikikɔ mate mbala rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi nzu awu. Gba rɛshi nzu akwu iso isomo iyi Ukpo, la ki wo yi mate mbala ikwu idu fulo nzu iyi bɔkɔ ki yi yi; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />gba akwu ɛduma iwomo la enzu, la ki wo yi ɔnyɛnyɛ; gba akwiyi kiya izɔma, la ki zɔ yi ɔnyɛnyɛ; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />gba akwiyi enzu ɛnwu ikɔma, la ki wo yi ɔnyɛnyɛ. Onzu uwu ee shi kiya la enzu umba o yi igɔ le shi mu egbo ikpɛnyi; gba akwu i bɔ kwunzu le wo yi laa ekpasu wu; gba akwu eyembembyi imama iyi enzu le wo yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu mu egbo ikpɛnyi. Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyi ira la lu towo ngyi mo, ingyeshi ba la lu kpangyi idu. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />La lu gyesu mate ɛmɛnɛ wa mbwalu tayi, akwɛyi la lu lomo lesu. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />La lu kiri ɛnwu mo lunyi ba la lu wo ɛduma la ekpasu yi. La lu wo fafa mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo iwomo. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Mu eyifulomo yi la lu yi egbo iruwu, la lu yidu mu inyashi imama yi, akwɛyi la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuyengwunanguna. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />La lu mbwama la wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ, agboga ba la lu na mba mu agba yi.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Enzu umba o lo yi inyashi la lu ta mba kenzu ungeshi, la lu ta mba kenzu ungeshi la lu ta mba ungira mo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />La lu mwɔnyɛ mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ɔnyɛ, la lu lo oga mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mu oga ilomo. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />La lu ŋɔ moloto mbala uwewe. La lu fulo ɛyi mu kadu mo, lunyi ba la lu ri imɛza mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu kiya mo awu. La lu to ɛyi tee lu kwu umba amasa mo.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />La lu gba la kwusa lu wa ungwu ira iyi bɔkɔ onzu e wo yi mo. Iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyeshi mu eyi iyi enzu gba la lu gyakpɔɔ mu iwomo le. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />La lu wo iyinayina mu ekpasu yi, kaa la lu yi iŋɔma iyi oloto mbala uwewe. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ɛmɛza mi la lu wa kwusa mo, lunyi la lu lafya la Ukpo le wo le mu amba wu. Moo te gba kwokpo kwu so le tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a zɔ tee, kwusa iwama akwu ungwa mi, Imi mii wa kwusa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Lunyi ba la lu wo ɛlɛ, mate bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu zɔ tee: Gba ogewa ŋa e ye la lonzu, shi wu kiya le ri; gba e yi ugbembyi, shi wu embyi le wo; mu iwomo ŋɔ ɛlɛ ŋɔɔ shi lovya lu ngbɛ wu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />La lu nyama kaa ira li ri yi mo mo; la lu ra la iyeshi kaa lu ri ira ma le.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ilomo Laa Wa To Keyi Umba Ogomineti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Onzu uwunawuna le lomo la wa to keyi umba ogwomineti, moo i yi ɛrama ikpikpɛnyi te iyi bɔkɔ i bo mizhikembo iyi Ukpo mo, ɛrama lɛɛbi Ukpo gba a ta yi le.<verse eid="ROM 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e towo ɛrama iyi ɛzhi ma, e towo iso Ukpo mo, uwu ba o yi wu ombu. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Moo wazombu o lo enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu iyeshi iwomo iyi mo, umba ba o lo enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ira iwomo iyi. Ŋɔ gyi te kaa ki wiyi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ ombu moo? De ba wo iyeshi, akwɛyi o pwɔ ŋɔ ma, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />moo umba akwu ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo e shi kaa lo yi ɛduma. Akwiyi gba lu wo iyira, de ba wiyi, moo a ra la kepo unga kamba shaa bi mo. Akwu ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ira. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba akwu mega kaa onzu le lomo laa wa to keyi umba ɛzhi, akwu kwuwongu ombu izɔma kɛɛkyi mo, ba lakwu kwuwongu egbo mbo i so mbo te lo wo tayi.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ tete gba ifate la lu shi Oba uwɛzhi yi le, moo wa to keyi akwu ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo, umba bɔkɔ o to kwuye mbo o ta la ɛduma iwomo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Shi onzonzu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu rangyi mba; La lu shi oba uwɛzhi yi mbala uwu apula yi, la lu lombo mo ba la lu shi mbo umwɔ lɛɛbi.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La lu Lomo Laa Esu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />La lu ra la kwɔkpa mo, kwokpa ungwu luu rangwu gba lakwu ungwu bɔkɔ idɛnyi iyesu ipwumo, moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu uwopo wu de ba a mbwalu ɛrama. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ɛrama i zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ki yama mo; Ki ngbɛ onzu mo; Ki wɛlɔ mo; Ki se eyi mu kiya ingyi onzu uwufo mo,&gt;&gt; ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mbala iyifo yi, o ngbɛ yi o lo mesu akwu ɛrama ikpɛnyi tee: &lt;&lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu unukpaŋa kyamate ɛŋɔ tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Idɛnyi ii wo onzu uwa a nɔ a kpa wu ira mo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ idɛnyi gba akwu inyɔlɔma i yi ɛrama le.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Akwu mega kaa wo ɛlɛ, moo ŋɔ yitu te kwuye kwu bo-o kaa onzu la nyeyimo mu ondo. Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o sa nzu ma le kwu bo kɛlɛ i ka kwuyengwu kwonze ungwu bɔkɔ ki kwu idu lu fulo le mo. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Eyi i nda laa ilama fo, kwɔfyi kwu bo kɛlɛ-ɛ. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu shi ɛduma iyi ipwu mɛzhi akwɛyi ki lo ewulo iyi ewa itomo mu ɛbɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />La ki zɛ luzɛ marimari, kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛbɛ iyi ɔnɔnda tayi, moo la lu so mu odumudumu uwakuu kaa atɛ lo yi mo mo, ba la lu to kaya mo, naa inyama iwomo mo, na ewa ikirimo naa anya iwomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Lunyi ba la lu to ewulo iyi ewa iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu ɛnwu, kaa la lu se alu yi ma mbaa ingbomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala i shi ɛnwu kaa li mwɔnyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ki Zɔ Ombu Uwu Enzu Umbafo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />La lu na enzu umba bɔkɔ ikwu idu lu fulo mbo i funyashi, lunyi ba la lu ri kambu mbala mba mɔgɔ uwu apula iyi bɔkɔ o ka amasa yi mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Ikwidufulo iyi enzu umbafo i shi mbo o ri kiya ingyinangyina bi, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a funyashi iyi ikwu idu lu fulo e ri epu kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri kiya ingyinaingyina awu la nzhii onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri mo awu mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri kiya ingyinaingyina mo awu ba laa zɔ ombu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ri awu mo, moo Ukpo a na wu-a. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Uŋɔ ba ŋɔ kwu uwe bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ zɔ ombu uwu Umɛgba uwu onzu uwufo? Akwu Adakwogba mba gba aa zɔ le te e wo ɔnyɛ naa e wo ɔnye mo le. Akwɛyi aa rima, moo Ɔkwu e do te ee shi wu kaa la rima.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Enzu umbafo o ka te kwɔfyi ungufo kwu ka afyi iyifo ma; onzu uwufo a ma yi te afyi i yi kyakya. Onzonzu la rala iyi egbo wu. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o to kwɔfyi ungufo te kwu ka le awu, o wo tayi kaa lo lomo la Ɔkwu, kwuwongu o gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi iyi kiya ingyirimo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo apula iyifo irimo awu o wo tayi kaa lakwu ilomo la Ɔkwu, akwɛyi o gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Moo onzu ukpukpɛnyi te e yi la reyi kwuwongu ɛnwu wu kɛɛkyi mo, tayi gba onzu ukpukpɛnyi te e kpomo kwuwongu ɛnwu wu kɛɛkyi mo le . <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Akwiyi gba ki yi lareyi, ki yi lareyi la Ɔkwu; tayi gba i yi le akwiyi gba ki kpomo, ki kpomo la Ɔkwu. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba ki yi la reyi naa ki kpomo, ki kwu umba Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ROM 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba Okrasi e kpomo akwɛyi a gba e yi la reyi kaa la kwu Ɔkwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o yi la reyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Uŋɔ kɔ, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ zɔ ombu uwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ? Naa kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ zhii umɛnɛ ŋɔ ma? Moo lɛɛbi nzu kii rima mu keyi unga ukpa uwu ombu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a zɔ te, tabɔkɔ mi yi la reyi,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;Epunu lɛɛbi ii kwumo midu mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">enzu lɛɛbi oo nyama te Imi mi kwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzonzu nzu a zɔ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e wo laa Ukpo.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ki Shi Umɛnɛ Ŋɔ Le Ngbomo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki lafya la ombu uwesu izɔma. I yi bɔkɔ i shoshi tee ka wo gba akwu tee, ki nyama kaa kwu kwoki ungwu ɛfi ilama naa kiya ingyi ingbomo la umɛnɛ ŋɔ mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Tabɔkɔ mi yi mbala Ɔkwu Ɔzhiisɔs le, mi nyama te kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki wuluma mo ki yi mo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e to kiya te ki wuluma mo, de kiya ngyɛngyi ki wuluma mbaa onzu awu mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Akwiyi gba enzu umbafo o wo ubugyi kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ri, de ba ŋɔ yi mu luzɛ mu idɛnyi mo. Ki shi kaa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ri la ki shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ Okrasi e kpomo kwuwo wu awu la tama mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ki lafya la kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma te ki shoshi kaa lo siso ngyi kyamate ingyira mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Moo irɛsu iyi Ukpo akwu kwuwongu kiya irimo mbala embyi iwomo bi mo, inyi ba akwu ototo, idigbomo mbala ɔnyɛ iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />kwuwongu onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e gbo Okrasi ɔya mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ, de ba Ukpo a mwɔnyɛ mbala akwɛyi enzu ba oo pwɔ wu ma.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la ki yi esu idu mo kaa la ki wo kiya ingyi ki bo la idigbomo mbala i yi bɔkɔ i mbwa nzu ma kaa la ki ka esu ɛnwu ma. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ki tutu ɛduma iyi Ukpo ma kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo mo. Kiya ingyirimo lɛɛbi ki wuluma, inyi gba ishoshi te ka onzu le ri kiya ingyinaingyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki bi shi onzu le ngbomo mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ishoshi kaa onzu le kwu kwuvye naa le wo atɛ naa le wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki shi umanyi wu la kpa mɛzhi mo.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, rala ikwu idu lu fulo ŋɔ iyi ŋɔ yi mu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mekeka ŋa mbala Ukpo ŋɔ. Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ma te e ri ombu uwoyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o to ombu o ri wu mo. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ egbo wu akwu epepo de o ngbɛ wu ombu uwoyi akwiyi gba e ri, kwuwongu kiya irimo wu akwu mu ikwu idu fulo mo; kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki ngyi mu ikwu idu lu fulo mo akwu ingbomo.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">La lu Ka Esu Ɛnwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Kinzu umba ki kɔma mu ikwu idu lu fulo la ki mbwala enzu umba bɔkɔ o kɔma mu ikwu idu lu fulo mo mu ewulo mbo ishimo. La ki wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ kinzu ki gyi bi mo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />La ki wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki shela wa mbwalu Ɔzhiisɔs umbafo kaa lakwu iyesheshi nzu, kaa li nɔngɔ mba ma mu ikwu idu lu fulo mbo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Moo Okrasi e wo kiya ingyi ki shela ɛnwu wu byi mo, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo awu te: &lt;&lt;Ari iyi bɔkɔ enzu o kpa ŋa awu i kpo ma mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Moo apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma mekyi awu o ka yi te kaa li zɔ nzu kiya, kwuwongu kaa la ki yi idu kwɔku mbala ɛnwu ɛkɔ iyi kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu shi nzu kaa la ki yi eyifulomo awu.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi idu iyimo mbala ɛnwu ɛkɔ awu le shi yi Kwundu ungwu ikpa kyaa mate bɔkɔ lu mondo luzɛ undu Okrasi Ɔzhiisɔs, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kwuwongu kaa lɛɛbi yi la lu kpa kya kaa la lu du Ukpo mbala ete uwu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhiisɔs Okrasi ma mu opwu ukpɛnyi.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Iyesheshi Laa Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Azhu Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />La lu na esu mu egbo ikpɛnyi, kyamate bɔkɔ Okrasi a na yi tayi kaa Ukpo la fya iduma ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />La lu lolo te Okrasi akwu Umɛgba uwu enzu umba Azhu kaa li zɔ te Ukpo e wo iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi te e wo, kaa iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi la asɔkwu mba li nyɔlɔma <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kwuwongu kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo awu lo shi Ukpo inzumbɛku kwuwongu eyembembyi wu kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Mii du ŋɔ ma mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Mii so ŋɔ amu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kwokpo kwu gba kwu so kpɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;La lu mwɔnyɛ, lunyi enzu umba bɔkɔ lu ku Azhu mo, mbala enzu umba Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kwokpo kwu so kpɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;La lu du Ukpo ma lɛɛbi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu ku Azhu mo awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">la lu so amu iyi iduma la wu, enzu lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kwokpo ungwu Azaya kwu so kpɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo aa wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Ozhese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">uwu bɔkɔ e rɛsu mu ɛzhi lɛɛbi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo awu o fulo eyi ma wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ukpo u shi eyi ifulomo awu la nyɔlɔ yi ma mu ɔnyɛ mbala idigbomo uwu bɔkɔ lu fulo egbo ma wu awu, kwuwongu eyi ifulomo yi li sheyi keyi mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyi Ungwu Kwu Shi Ɔpɔlu A Ka Ɛzu Laa Egbo Ikpɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ɛmɛza mi, Imi mafyi mi mi nyama tee, lunyi lu nyɔlɔma mu esheshi, lu nyɔlɔma mu iyitu, ba lu do esu kiya izɔma. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Imi mi ka kwupu kwɔlɛ laa iyi mo meka iyi iso iyifo iyi bɔkɔ mi gyite la mi lolo yi kpɔ, kwuwongu esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />kaa mi kwu Umɛgba uwu u tanu iyi Okrasi Ɔzhiisɔs la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. Mi gbo oya kyamate oboshi tayi mu anu itama iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ i wɔ mu Ukpo, kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo awu lo na Ukpo ma, Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to mbo e shi Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ikpa kyaa mbala Okrasi Ɔzhiisɔs akwɛyi mi kwɛnwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi mii wo la Ukpo. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Imi mi so gedegede iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Okrasi e wo meka mi iyi kaa la mi bo la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo kaa lo lomo la Ukpo. Okrasi e wo ɛlɛ mu iso mi mbala kiya ingyi mi wo, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />mu ekpasu iyi apula iyi amɛ mbala iyi izele, mbala mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i na mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ nzhii ba Iliriku, Mi tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi marimari. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Egbo mi i yi te mi tanu iyi ilɔ iyi Isheshi iyi Okrasi mɔgɔ bɔkɔ o yitu iyi Okrasi mo, kwuwongu kaa la mi la ɔla la onzu uwufo. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o so mbo iso wu awu o ma wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o di pwa dɛ mo o zɔngɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Ka Amasa Iyi Kaa Le So La Ma Enzu Umba Oromu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba o koko o se mi ɔgwuzɛ uwu i bo munyi yi ma le. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Imi ba mi mbwa ɛduma iya mi ma-a mu ɛzhi ɛlɛ, lɔri guruguru Mi gyikpɔ kaa la mi so munyi yi kaa la mi ma yi, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />mi ka amasa kaa la mi so munyi yi kwuyengwu mi ka mu Osupeni. Mi ka te mi zɛ munyi yi kwuyengwu mi yi mu ipikama awu kaa la lu mbwa mi ma ka la mi so mɔmɔ, mizhikembo iyi mi mwɔnyɛ iyi imama iyi bɔkɔ mi ma yi kwuye bwɛɛ awu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kekelele ba mi sheyimo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ka la mi ka la wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ awu la rɛshi. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Moo wa mbwalu umba Omasedoniya mbala Akaya o ka amasa ka lo wo rɛshi la ayirewa meka iyi enzu umba Ukpo umba o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />O mwɔnyɛ kaa lo wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu o ma te o rala kwokpa mba. Moo akwiyi gba enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo o yi kwuwo mu esheshi iyi Kwundu iyi bɔkɔ akwiyi umba Azhu, o rala enzu umba Azhu kwokpa ungwu kaa lo ka apula mba ma mbala mba. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mizhikembo iyi Mi mbwa ɛduma ɛlɛ ma akwɛyi mi gbala lɛɛbi iyi eduwo iyi bɔkɔ o kpala yi ɛlu awu mi shi mbo, mi re mu Osupeni akwɛyi mi ma yi kwuyengwu mi sheyimo. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Kwuye ungwu mi bo munyi yi, mi yitu te mi nyɔ mbala esheshi iyi Okrasi duduu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mi so yi, ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi, meka iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhiisɔs Okrasi mbala meka iyi idɛnyi iyi Kwundu, kaa lo lɛ Ukpo kwuwo mi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />La lu lɛ Ukpo te la wa mi ma mu kwuwo ungwu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ozhudiya awu akwɛyi enzu umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mɔmɔ awu o do te o na ɔya mi. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Kwuwongu kaa mu inyama iyi Ukpo mi nyɔ munyi yi la ɔnyɛ akwɛyi ki ka esu ɛnwu ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Mii lɛ Ukpo te Ukpo u shi idigbomo le yi mbala yi lɛɛbi. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɛlɛ Ɛmɛza Wu Ɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Imi mi yi iso iyeshi iyi mi so meka iyi umanyi nzu okokpayi Ofibi, u wo ɛduma mu ɔshɔshi mu Osekiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te la lu na wu kwuwongu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu mate ifate bɔkɔ enzu umba Ukpo lo wo, la lu mbwa wu ma mu imbwama iyi bɔkɔ aa gagyi munyi yi, moo a mbwa la enzu ma gyɔ ikyo mi tete.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />La lu gbɛlɛ Opirisila mbala Akwila ɛnyi, enzu umba bɔkɔ ki wo ɛduma kyaa iyi Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi; <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />o ra lakwunyɔ mba o shi kwuwo mi. Mi gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi, akwu Imi kɛɛkyi mo ikyo wa mbwalu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo tete. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />La lu gbɛlɛ wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o kpala ɛlu mu kwogba mba ɛnyi tete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">La lu gbɛlɛ umɛza mi Epenetu ɛnyi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu onzu uwu kwonze bɔkɔ e kwu idu lu fulo mu Okrasi mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />La lu gbɛlɛ Omeri ɛnyi, uwu e wo ɛduma iyɛkɔkɔ kwuwo yi. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />La lu gbɛlɛ Adirɔnikɔ mbala Ozhuniyasi ɛnyi, onzu uwu kwomba mi uwu bɔkɔ o ta mba mu ugu ugyi mbala mi awu; o yitu mbo marimari meka iyi wazilɔ, akwɛyi umba o mbwalu Okrasi keyi la mi.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />La lu gbɛlɛ Opalati ɛnyi, uwu bɔkɔ mi pwu idɛnyi wu mu Ɔkwu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />La lu gbɛlɛ Ubanusu ɛnyi, onzu uwu ɛduma nzu iyi Okrasi, mbala umɛza mi kasɛkɛ Isitaki. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />La lu gbɛlɛ Apɛlɛ ɛnyi, uwu bɔkɔ imbwalu Okrasi wu o nyama la yi. La lu gbɛlɛ enzu umba kwogba ungwu Arisitobulu ɛnyi. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />La lu gbɛlɛ Ɛrɔdiyɔ, umɛnɛ mi Ozhu ɛnyi, mbala wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Onasisu ɛnyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />La lu gbɛlɛ Turufena mbala Turufosa, umba bɔkɔ oo wo ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu ɛnyi, mbala umɛza mi kasɛkɛ Opasisi ɛnyi, uwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu iyɛkɔkɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Gbɛlɛ Orufu ɛnyi, uwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a ŋa wu mbala anyi wu, uwu bɔkɔ e to mi mate umɛ wu tayi awu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Gbɛlɛ Asukiritu, Ɔfɛligɔ, Ɛmɛsi, Opatiroba, Ɛmasi mbala ɛmɛnɛ wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ e yi mbala mba awu. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Gbɛlɛ Ofilologu, Ozhuliya, Ɔnɛru mbala umanyi wu okokpayi, mbala Olipasi mbala enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala mba awu ɛnyi. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />La lu gbɛlɛ esu ɛnyi la egbo ikpɛnyi, la lu kpa esu idu. Wambwalu Okrasi lɛɛbi o ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okpa Umbwambwa Uwu Ɔpɔlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mi so yi ɛmɛmbɛnɛ, la lu ngbɛndu mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo la ikama akwɛyi o wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki shi enzu kaa lo ngbomo akwɛyi o zɔ ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ i yi ikikɔ mbala iyi Okrasi bɔkɔ enzu o yitu yi awu. Lunyi la lu zɛ gboo la lu shi mbo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Uzhi uwu enzu mbamba tayi o yi mu Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu ɔya igbomo mo, o yi mu kwɔsubu mba ɔya igbomo byi. Mu iso iyi inyima isomo mbala iso iyi kwukyoro ba o kyoro enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu ogbuduru uwu kiya awu ma. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Onzu uwunawuna ba e yitu te uŋɔ ŋɔ yi ilomo, ɛlɛ i shi mi ɔnyɛ gyɔɔ. Mi gyi te kaa yi amasa mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyeshi ba lakwu ogbuduru uwu kiya ingyira.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ukpo uwu idigbomo e shɛkɛ onzu uwoyi awu ma kekelele akwɛyi ee shi yi ekpasu mu reshi wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Otimoti, onzu uwopo mi uwu bɔkɔ kii wo ɛduma kyaa awu, e ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma; mbala Ɔlushiyɔ, Ɔzhasɔ, mbala Ososipata Ozhu umɛnɛ mi.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Imi Ɔtatiyɔ uwu bɔkɔ mi ka kwupwu kwɔlɛ le, mi ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ɔgayɔ uwu bɔkɔ Imi mi kwu ugboga wu ba ɔshɔshi o kpala ɛlu mu kwogba wu awu, e ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erasitu, u ra la kɛnɛ unga eduwo iyi kwuse, mbala Kaatu o ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhiisɔs Okrasi li yi mbala yi. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpo Ilɛma Uwu Ɔpɔlu Uwu Iduma Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Ukpo e domo te e shi ŋɔ ɛnwɛkɔ, kyamate bɔkɔ ilɔ iyesheshi i so awu te, akwu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala amasa iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, Amasa iyi bɔkɔ akwu invyemo i wɔ mi yo mɛzhi, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />kekelele ba kyamate bɔkɔ anukenzu o so ba Ukpo uwɔkpɔɔ a manda-a, iso ɛnyi o ta ya nduu la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo munamuna-a, kaa lo kwu idu lu fulo akwɛyi o lomo laa Okrasi <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />so mɔgɔ uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ uwu kɛɛkyi gba e yitu le, kaa le yi inzumbɛku iyɔkpɔɔ i zɛ meka iyi Ɔzhiisɔs Okrasi! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>